From 351a7b0b970bb7065ae59d59a7fce640642e0621 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:32:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gfx: iOS memory convergence, mip skip, MetalFX 30-to-60, and
 parallel shader compile

Consolidate adaptive iOS memory-pressure convergence (0055), DM_NVN_TEX_MIP_SKIP static texture mip skip (0074), MetalFX 30-to-60 optical-flow frame generation (0076), and maximized concurrent shader compilation on MTL4 (0077).

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Improve iOS GPU memory stability, frame rate scaling, and offline/runtime Metal shader compilation speed
Issue: none
